Read UVI4 state frames, clear UFS names and bounded NI members

UVI program readers accept the UVI4 + version + length + zlib state frame
with a 32 MiB limit, exact length and no trailing data. UFS readers honour
the encoded-name flag (header 304) and root pointer (header 40); clear
banks load without an installed reader. NIFileContainer gains a bounded
read_member. Verified: 37 UVI unit tests, 32 NI compatibility tests, and
all 26 local banks resolve 127,828 files and 1,409 folders.

Source: thread 8ed6293f reader-improvements (DSP_FORMAT_SPECIFICATION UFS
and UVI program sections).

